  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/title_new.png\" alt=\"HBM Title\" width=\"1303\" height=\"326\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-100000?style=for-the-badge&logo=GitHub&logoColor=white&labelColor=000000&color=F56E06\" alt=\"Hbm Git\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Auq95eCEtD\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-100000?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=white&labelColor=000000&color=F57E05\" alt=\"Hbm Discord\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ntm.fandom.com/wiki/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-100000?style=for-the-badge&logo=Fandom&logoColor=white&labelColor=black&color=F58D03\" alt=\"Hbm Wiki\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei/files/all?filter-game-version=2020709689:6756\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/JEI-100000?style=for-the-badge&logo=Joplin&logoColor=white&labelColor=black&color=F59C02\" alt=\"Jei\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/blob/Custom-1.12.2/CraftTweakerWIKI.md\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CraftTweaker-100000?style=for-the-badge&logo=hackthebox&logoColor=white&labelColor=black&color=F4AB00\" height=\"28\"> </a> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/Description-10-11-2022.png\" alt=\"Description\" width=\"297\" height=\"40\"> </span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/line.png\" alt=\"Line\" width=\"1920\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组专注于建造核反应堆、火箭、核弹、武器和掩体。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它基于 Drillgon 和 HBM 的出色工作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由于该模组的配方数量庞大且复杂，强烈建议使用 JEI（Just Enough Items）。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNTM%253fr%253dcurseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/bisect-banner.png\" alt=\"Bisect code NTM\" width=\"1303\" height=\"261\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/Features-10-11-2022.png\" alt=\"Features\" width=\"233\" height=\"40\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/line.png\" alt=\"Line\" width=\"1920\" height=\"20\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">顾名思义，本模组完全关于科技、原子科学和核武器。它拥有庞大的技术树，包含各种加工和辅助机器、可制作的炸弹和导弹、枪械以及可供探索的废弃建筑。核弹不再只是绿色的 TNT 方块——你将必须合成新型炸药并浓缩铀，才能向你的朋友们发射核导弹。</span> </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">核弹 </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">导弹 </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">武器 </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">大型机器 </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">辐射及其他危险 </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/Screenshots-10-11-2022.png\" alt=\"Screenshots\" width=\"332\" height=\"40\"> </span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/line.png\" alt=\"Line\" width=\"1920\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">图片胜过千言万语。 </span> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/522/290/002.png\" alt=\"Crater\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"> </span> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/672/164/2023-06-05_16.png\" alt=\"New oil stuff\" width=\"1168\" height=\"1080\"> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/672/160/2023-06-04_00.png\" alt=\"Silo\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"> </span> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/523/977/2022-11-21_20.png\" alt=\"Rockets\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/Installation-10-11-2022.png\" alt=\"Installation\" width=\"324\" height=\"40\"> </span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/line.png\" alt=\"Line\" width=\"1920\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组没有特殊的依赖项，因此安装过程如下：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">下载 .jar 文件 </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在你的 1.12.2 Minecraft 配置中安装 Forge 加载器 </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">启动游戏一次（或手动创建 mods 文件夹） </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">进入 .minecraft 目录，将 jar 文件放入 mods 文件夹中 </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/Faq-21-11-2022.png\" alt=\"Faq\" width=\"87\" height=\"40\"> </span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/line.png\" alt=\"Line\" width=\"1920\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>问：这是官方的 1.12.2 版本 HBM 吗？ </strong> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">答：并没有所谓的“官方”1.12.2 NTM 版本。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>问：你为什么开始修改 1.12.2 版本的 NTM？ </strong> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">答：在我注意到 1.7.10 版本拥有 RBMK 起重机、 FEL、铅-209 等酷炫功能，而 1.12.2 版本不再更新后，我开始进行模组修改。于是我决定自己对其进行更新。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>问：你使用的是什么光影包？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">答：我使用的是一款名为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/complementary-shaders/files/all?filter-game-version=2020709689:6756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shader</a> 的光影包，但使用了自定义的天空和水颜色配置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>问：本模组与 NTM Reloaded 有什么区别？ </strong> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">答：NTM Extended 修复了更多错误，拥有更多内容，并且性能更好。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.textstudio.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">字体生成器</a></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alcatergit/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-GIT/Custom-1.12.2/static_banners/Special-Thanks-to-HBM-and-Dril-10-11-2022.png\" alt=\"Thanks\" width=\"3001\" height=\"480\"> </span></p>",
